<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114255" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόᾰν-ος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hollow in which metal was placed for melting,
			melting-pot,</i> from which it was run into the mould, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῦσαι δ᾽ ἐν χοάνοισιν . . ἐφύσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.470
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κασσίτερος . . ἐν εὑτρήτοις χοάνοισιν
					θαλφθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					863
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				96.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Cord.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.1299
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> poet. for 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίγδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			, <i>mould for casting</i> metal in, <i><span class="en">
				Anacr.
				116
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοάνη</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i>funnel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Cord.</u>
				2
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῶνος,</span> as in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLeid.X.</u>
				29B.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>).</div>
